<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-24T12:49:37.873Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:49:37 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces fired across the border into southern Syria, killing a disabled Syrian man in the Daraa buffer zone and deploying rooftop snipers who opened fire in the south. Two Syrian security officers were killed in a raid on an ISIL cell near Damascus, while security operations in Rankous and a separate incident in the Damascus countryside saw further clashes. Protesters gathered across Syria to denounce repeated Israeli incursions, and a road linking Damascus and Suwayda was blocked amid demands for detainees' release, while the Sweida-Damascus highway was completely closed by outlaw groups. Arms depot explosions in Syria left 37 dead, according to reports. 2732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNRzFxMmE4dWx3blk3Yy1MSGJTOXI4NC1URUM3OFBTdzdKUGRWWWRLLXl2bXJfNmoxLXJ6dmN3RFdmU0pRanZsN3dMXzZWaDRpbFhhdm1wanFDQ2FkdUxGcFoyaW41MjkwMER1RDVfRF9MLTgxcTlCMl9tTGgzOFNWV2NublFLUkM2VjBDU3A5Wm9SdVZfeEFyQlRjc09yc0pocTF1emZPMlJ2dVUzRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/22/two-syrian-security-officers-killed-in-raid-on-isil-cell-near-damascus&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE9jZ3h5blE5R1RFVTZSdDNMampvdXcxaXkzVk5Rdl9VbzljYnFSRkRocUh3TUdxejlfRHZJSHk1TDlTby1TS1F0TFRTUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE90aFBGWl9WQjZEbGpMSVBTMzlVeVhsMUFaXzZzc0pIOHdscUxwU2l1QjRJNWFVb2VzX3pIOG9feWdUMFhOVk1ZdQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQWkxvd0ZjYkYtMVJRTTJTTGVTTDRlNTEyakF4T2I1a1VPYUJqYlBWV2dBU0NFRjV4ZVd